      "content": "90% engagement feels really high, almost too high compared to what I'm seeing on the ground. \n\nIf we go ahead with this massive increase in inventory and the trend actually crashes like these reports suggest, it’s going to be a huge hit to our margins and my department's budget. \n\nCan you walk me through the specific data points or the exact surge in interest you're seeing from these younger demographics? I need to see the actual trend lines for the last 72 hours to justify pushing this through to the board. I'm worried we might be missing a sudden pivot in the market.",
